---
import { withBase } from '../../lib/paths';
---

<div class="card-panel reveal">
  <h2 class="text-3xl text-white font-semibold">Move from concept to controlled execution.</h2>
  <p class="mt-2 text-muted">
    If you're evaluating AI systems for a small team or solo operator, we can scope a practical, measurable implementation path.
  </p>
  <div class="mt-5 flex flex-wrap gap-3">
    <a href={withBase('/contact')} class="chip" data-cta="cta_contact">Open project intake form</a>
    <a href={withBase('/services')} class="chip" data-cta="cta_services">Review service tracks</a>
    <a href={withBase('/projects')} class="chip" data-cta="cta_projects">See project proofs</a>
  </div>
</div>
